{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object, scan area. If object properties are met, do subtask. Then take object.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsPathClear    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTask    />",
